{"id":"wb-5-499","name":"彭德怀故居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"彭德怀故居","text":"彭德怀故居位于中国湖南省湘潭县乌石镇乌石村彭家围子，现存建筑是彭德怀任湘军营长时出资续建，始建于1925年。原为三间茅草屋，在今故居东北30米处。清光绪二十四年（1898年）彭德怀出生于此。\n建筑座西北朝东南，砖木结构，泥砖墙，小青瓦，房屋17间，总占地面积2,490平方米，主体建筑面积350平方米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BD%AD%E5%BE%B7%E6%80%80%E6%95%85%E5%B1%85","revisionId":88914015,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88914015","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5d583bd444910b93945ef6dd.jpg","title":"Peng's_house,_Former_Residence_of_Peng_Dehuai,_7_April_2020A.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Peng%27s_house,_Former_Residence_of_Peng_Dehuai,_7_April_2020A.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1d/Peng%27s_house%2C_Former_Residence_of_Peng_Dehuai%2C_7_April_2020A.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Huangdan2060","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"​湖南省湘潭市乌石镇彭德怀故居的房屋。","width":320,"height":213}}